~ start
Hannibal: I've been looking for you.
P: Have we met?
Hannibal: I've killed you countless times before. But this moment in time keeps repeating.
Hannibal: End this fight, why ado you keep coming back? 
$> playResume("e2")
Hannibal: You will die
set Global.cutsceneStarted = false
=> END

~ P2
Hannibal: Gods. Devils. Indulge me and feed me your strength.
Hannibal: Ensure they cannot cross any further and end our realm.
Hannibal: They must rot and be trapped here forever.
Hannibal: ...
Hannibal: Tell me...
Hannibal: If you complete your mission, but I leave a mark on your memory...
Hannibal: Do I really cease to exist?...
Hannibal: Doesn't matter really...as you won't get that far.
$> Global.Clash.Start("clash", "clashing", "clashW", "clashL", "clash_result", "P2")


~ clash_result
if Global.clash_won:
	Hannibal: *cough* *cough* All... All for a test, right?
	Hannibal: Guess I should at least give you a show.
else:
	Hannibal: its over.
set Global.cutsceneStarted = false
do Global.player.anim()
=> END

~ d1
Hannibal: I...
do Global.prompt.holdPrompt("Dash", [Vector2(800, 600), Vector2(5.0, 5.0)])
do Global.prompt.holdPrompt("jump", [Vector2(800, 600), Vector2(5.0, 5.0)])
Hannibal: I won't give in 
$> Global.prompt.startQTE(10.0, "HD1_2", "HD2", "HD2_3", "death")

~ death
Hannibal: *cough* I hope it was worth it...
Hannibal: You will see me again, it may be in different attire...but the motive will be the same.
Hannibal: See you soon. Player. 
$> playEnd("HD2_2")
set Global.cutsceneStarted = false
do Global.player.anim()
=> END